Workspace contains both Flutter frontend and Node backend.

Important:
- For Flutter commands, set working directory to:
  student-attendance-tracker-216606-216615/attendance_tracker_frontend

- For Backend (Node API + Postgres), use:
  student-attendance-tracker-216606-216615/backend
  and its subfolder node-api for API specific npm operations.

If your CI reports: "Could not determine project root directory for Flutter project",
ensure you are running Flutter commands from the Flutter app root (see above) or use:
bash student-attendance-tracker-216606-216615/print_flutter_project_root.sh
